"""Package marker for the vendored third-party code.

The subdirectories that carry build rules of their own -- libunwindstack,
libbase, xxHash-r42, ... -- are packages in their own right. This file keeps
the ones that do not out of the root package.

Those remaining directories fall into two groups:

  * License text for dependencies Bazel fetches rather than vendors: capstone,
    LLVM, Outcome, Qt, protobuf, vulkan, and the DIA SDK. The CMake build
    collected these into a NOTICE file for the distribution; the Bazel build
    has no equivalent yet, so they are kept as its inputs.

  * Sources for features the Bazel port left disabled: libprotobuf-mutator
    (the `*Fuzzer.cpp` targets) and VulkanTutorial (the Vulkan path of
    IntegrationTestPuppet, behind `#ifdef VULKAN_ENABLED`).
"""

package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])

licenses(["notice"])
